    <briefdescription>
<para>Wraps a BFI to allow lazy computation of the block frequencies. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A pass that only conditionally uses BFI can uncondtionally require the analysis without paying for the overhead if BFI doesn&apos;t end up being used. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
